{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14848","headline":"慈恩寺石磬歌 · 卢纶","name":"慈恩寺石磬歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵山石磬生海西，海涛平处与山齐。\n长眉老僧同佛力，呪使鲛人往求得。\n珠穴沈成绿浪痕，天衣拂尽苍苔色。\n星汉徘徊山有风，禅翁静扣月明中。\n羣仙下云龙出水，鸾鹤交飞半空里。\n山精木魅不可听，落叶秋砧一时起。\n花宫杳杳响泠泠，无数沙门昏梦醒。\n古廊灯下见行道，疎林池边闻诵经。\n徒壮洪钟秘高阁，万金费尽工雕凿。\n岂如全质挂青松，数叶残云一片峯。\n吾师宝之寿中国，愿同劫石无终极。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}